6Bootstrap 5 Features 
1. Updated official documentation 
2. jQuery is removed completely 
3. Switch to Vanilla JavaScript 
4. Dropped support of Internet Explorer 10 and 11 
5. Responsive Fonts 
6. Removed Cards 
7. Updated Forms 
8. New SVG and Icons library 

