9Bootstrap 5 Layout Grid System 
 
BootStrap5 Layout Grid system is responsive. It comes 
with a flexbox and allows up to 12 columns across the 
page. 
Grid options 
Auto-layout columns 
Responsive classes 
Nesting 
Sass 
Customizing the grid 


