11Bootstrap 5 Tables 
 
Bootstrap 5 provides a series of classes that can be used 
to apply various styling to the tables such as changing 
the heading appearance, making the rows striped, 
adding or removing borders, making rows hoverable, 
etc. Bootstrap also provides classes for making tables 
responsive .


